@startuml
title Resumefolio | Actual submitted-material capture
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify authorized application and user-reported submission context;
:Identify resume and cover letter actually submitted;
if (Required material / provenance conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
 :Capture the defined actual submitted set;
 if (Required preservation completed?) then (yes)
  :Identify preserved material separately from editable source; <<#DCFCE7>>
  :Record progress under agreed capture / status coupling;
 else (failed / partial)
  :Show incomplete preservation and defined next action; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (incomplete)
 :Retain distinguishable incomplete outcome; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Preserve prior historical material under correction / resubmission policy;
stop
legend bottom
This models recording, not automatic external job submission.
A current live resume is not proof of what was actually sent.
Final application states, capture trigger and coupling remain open.
endlegend
@enduml
